  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Three-way matching compares the purchase order (what was ordered), the receiving report (what was received), and the vendor invoice (what the vendor is billing). Per COBIT 2019 DSS06, discrepancies among these three documents trigger an exception for investigation before payment is authorized.
